      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A new ambulatory payment classification code was created for observation, with a payment rate of $351. Three diagnoses qualify for reimbursement: congestive heart failure, chest pain, and asthma. Active physician involvement in assessment and writing orders is required. Nurses should document the time when physician orders were started."},
